{"id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-ccc.md","title":"Countable Chain Condition","display":"df-ccc — Countable Chain Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ccc","aliases":["58-df-ccc"],"display":"df-ccc — Countable Chain Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ccc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ccc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ccc — Countable Chain Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,A,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,A,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\np,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\np,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}antichain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq_P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}antichain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(p,q,P,\\leq_P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ccc}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ccc}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order relation is part of the predicate; the same carrier can support different forcing orders.</li>\n<li>Cohen forcing is c.c.c.; the former remark claiming 